<title>REPUBLIC OF IRELAND: Lamont sells UK warehouse for 5.65 mln stg.</title>
<headline>Lamont sells UK warehouse for 5.65 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>DUBLIN 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Lamont Holdings Plc said on Monday that it had agreed to dispose of its freehold interest in a warehouse and adjoining land at Darton, Barnsley to F.R. Evans(Leeds) Limited for 5.65 million sterling.</p>
<p>The consideration will be used by Lamont to reduce borrowings and the disposal should be completed on August 27, Lamont said in a statement.</p>
<p>A profit of 4.2 million over book value will arise on the disposal Lamont said there would be no impact on the 1997 profit and loss account as this loss was accounted for in the 1996 financial statements.</p>
<p>-- Dublin Newsroom +353 1 676 9779</p>
